WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,260
So that's it

2
00:00:01,260 --> 00:00:02,620
No injury, no strength, brother Tong

3
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:05,460
Do you want to use the acupoints of our chaotic sisters on the same stage to cause a sensation in the industry?

4
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:07,700
Create more publicity for your auction house and make more money

5
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:08,700
Since you want me to take the stage

6
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:10,300
Then I must officially join Tianbao

7
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:12,620
And the treatment must be exactly the same as my sister Liu Qingqing

8
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:13,780
The more you talk, the more outrageous you become.

9
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:14,820
I can get an annual salary of three million

10
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:17,300
It's because I'm the chief hammer auctioneer and you're the one carrying the plates.

11
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,540
Why do you want the same treatment?

12
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:20,540
I tried my best not to involve my sister in the company

13
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:22,100
I'm just afraid of rumors from the outside world.

14
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,740
Zhang Tong actually invited her

15
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,940
Does she really not care about the impact of the twins' gangsterism?

16
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,940
Don't argue with your sister

17
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:30,460
Then the treatment at the head office will be the same as other ordinary female employees, right?

18
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:31,690
No problem

19
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:33,370
New positions and project settlement

20
00:00:33,370 --> 00:00:34,690
Performance bonus calculated separately

21
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:37,490
Housing and image position allowances are implemented in accordance with company policies

22
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:39,970
This can ensure the deception effect of twins on the same stage.

23
00:00:39,970 --> 00:00:41,890
There will be no criticism due to excessive treatment

24
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:44,290
If she questions whether she wants to be on an equal footing with Liu Qingsi

25
00:00:44,290 --> 00:00:51,260
But I can't agree to open a prison. You are special.
